[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0218","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0218.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0211","title":"Tarantella Enterprise 3 安装脚本 gunzip 竞争条件漏洞","description":"Tarantella Enterprise 3 3.01至3.20版本的安装脚本中存在竞争条件漏洞。安装脚本在执行前创建了一个全局可写的临时 gunzip 程序，本地攻击者可在该程序创建后、执行前的短暂时间窗口内修改其内容，从而以 root 权限执行任意命令，完全控制受影响的系统。攻击需要本地访问权限且利用复杂度较高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0211"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:00Z","remediation":"升级 Tarantella Enterprise 3 至 3.20 以上版本（厂商安全公告 bulletin-04 提供补丁）。如无法升级，安装前手动设置 TMPDIR 为仅 root 可写的安全目录（如 /root/tmp），并确保安装过程中无其他本地用户登录系统。该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的替代产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101208650722179&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/265845","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7996.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3966","http://www.tarantella.com/security/bulletin-04.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21244","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0211.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0211","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0211.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0211.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9841ac21d9bcdb7f48d8ef999473e1abd131d5fe/2002/CVE-2002-0211.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0211.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aaacad1562c685f186ef7d9e0567254ada70ff63/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0211.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0211.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0211.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2002-0211.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0218.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0216","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0216.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0210","title":"TOLIS Group BRU 17.0 SetLicense脚本本地不安全临时文件符号链接漏洞","description":"TOLIS Group Backup and Restore Utility (BRU) 17.0 的 setlicense 脚本在处理临时文件时存在不安全的符号链接漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 /tmp/brutest.$$ 临时文件创建符号链接，利用该脚本的权限提升机制覆盖系统任意文件，导致权限提升或敏感数据破坏。攻击条件为拥有本地访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0210"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 TOLIS Group BRU 的修复版本（17.0 之后版本）。如无法升级，可移除 setlicense 脚本的 setuid/setgid 权限，或限制仅受信任用户可执行该脚本。临时缓解措施包括使用 mktemp 等安全函数创建临时文件，避免使用可预测的 PID 作为文件名后缀。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/252614","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8003.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3970","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21247","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0210.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0210.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0210","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0210.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0210.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6803c56f209ac0b3251a2751d06e0a641b57c323/2002/CVE-2002-0210.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0210.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aaacad1562c685f186ef7d9e0567254ada70ff63/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0210.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0210.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0210.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0216.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0215","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0215.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0209","title":"Nortel ACEdirector WebOS 服务器真实IP地址泄露漏洞","description":"Nortel Alteon ACEdirector WebOS 9.0 的服务器负载均衡（SLB）和基于 Cookie 的持久连接功能存在信息泄露漏洞。当客户端与后端 Web 服务器建立 HTTP 连接后，攻击者通过构造半关闭（half-closed）的 HTTP 会话，可导致 ACEdirector 在转发数据包时未能将后端服务器真实 IP 地址替换为虚拟 IP 地址，从而泄露后端服务器的真实 IP。远程攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞获取目标内网服务器 IP 信息，为进一步渗透提供攻击面。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0209"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:59Z","remediation":"升级 Nortel Alteon ACEdirector WebOS 至 9.0 以上已修复版本，或应用 ISS 提供的安全补丁。如无法升级，可禁用 Cookie-Based Persistence 功能，并在防火墙上限制对 ACEdirector 管理接口的访问来源，同时配置虚拟 IP 地址映射规则防止真实 IP 泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/252455","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/261548","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8010.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3964","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21243","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0209.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0209.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0209","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0209.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0209.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6803c56f209ac0b3251a2751d06e0a641b57c323/2002/CVE-2002-0209.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aaacad1562c685f186ef7d9e0567254ada70ff63/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0209.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0209.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0209.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2002-0209.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0215.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0214","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0214.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0207","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 8.0 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当处理特制媒体文件时，攻击者可通过构造一个头部长度值超过实际头部长度的恶意媒体文件，触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。攻击者只需诱使用户打开恶意媒体文件即可完成利用，无需其他权限。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 7.0 和 8.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0207"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:59Z","remediation":"升级 RealPlayer 至 8.0.5 及以上版本（build 6.0.9.584+），或升级至 RealOne Player。RealNetworks 已在 2002 年发布安全更新修复此缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，建议禁用 RealPlayer 对媒体文件的自动播放功能，并在网络边界过滤可疑的 .ra/.rm 文件传输。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2002-q1/0044.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/252414","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/252425","http://sentinelchicken.com/advisories/realplayer/","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7839.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3809","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21207","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0207.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0207","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0207.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0207.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6803c56f209ac0b3251a2751d06e0a641b57c323/2002/CVE-2002-0207.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0207.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0207.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0207.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0207.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2002-0207.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0214.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0212","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0212.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0206","title":"Francisco Burzi PHP-Nuke 任意文件包含漏洞","description":"PHP-Nuke 4.x 至 5.3.1 及更早版本（可能包括 5.5 之前版本）的 index.php 中存在任意文件包含漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 file 参数传递恶意 PHP 代码的 URL，利用该漏洞在目标服务器上执行任意 PHP 代码，导致敏感信息泄露、网站篡改或进一步渗透。攻击无需认证，仅需目标系统运行受影响版本的 PHP-Nuke 且 allow_url_fopen 选项开启即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0206"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 PHP-Nuke 至 5.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 index.php 中 file 参数未经验证即可包含远程文件的问题。如无法升级，在 php.ini 中设置 allow_url_include = Off 并禁用 allow_url_fopen，同时在代码层对 file 参数做白名单校验，仅允许包含本地预定义文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101121913914205&w=2","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/221683","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3889","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7914","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21230","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0206.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0206","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0206.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0206.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9b61e147dd97f8b10bc28655d49bf9e6a89e79e2/2002/CVE-2002-0206.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0206.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0206.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0206.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0206.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0206.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0212.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0212.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0212.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0210","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0210.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0201","title":"Cyberstop Web Server 长请求缓冲区溢出导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cyberstop Web Server for Windows 0.1 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送超长的 HTTP GET 请求触发该漏洞，导致服务崩溃（拒绝服务），在特定条件下可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Cyberstop Web Server 0.1 版本，攻击无需身份认证，通过网络即可远程利用，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0201"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:59Z","remediation":"Cyberstop Web Server 0.1 已停止维护，官方未发布安全补丁。建议立即停止使用该产品，迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx）。若无法立即替换，可在防火墙或 WAF 中配置规则，拦截长度超过 1024 字节的 HTTP GET 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101174569103289&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7960.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3930","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21237","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0201.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/bed70a0a2e2dec8bd34bd440f68f32280391094f/2002/CVE-2002-0201.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0201.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0201.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0201.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/74eb38d48bf4ff1f1c91e4f5d37b571a985efa6f/2002/CVE-2002-0201/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0201.json","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2002/CVE-2002-0201.md","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/db91f26a1aff997eee3fa35ea4621c471c8451b5/2002/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0201","https://github.com/alt3kx/CVE-2002-0201"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0210.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0170","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0170.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0185","title":"Gregory Trubetskoy mod_python 间接导入模块未授权访问漏洞","description":"mod_python 2.7.6及更早版本存在模块访问控制漏洞。该漏洞源于 Apache mod_python 的 publisher 机制设计缺陷：当某个 Python 模块被发布（published）后，该模块间接导入的其他模块也会暴露给 publisher，导致攻击者可绕过访问控制直接调用这些模块中的危险函数。攻击者只需能够访问已配置为发布的 URL 端点，即可远程调用可能具有危害性的函数，无需任何身份认证。该漏洞影响 Apache HTTP Server 使用 mod_python 模块的所有部署环境，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至 mod_python 2.7.8 或更高版本以修复此安全问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0185"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:57Z","remediation":"立即升级 mod_python 至 2.7.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复发布者模块对间接导入模块的非法访问限制。若无法升级，可通过 Apache 配置将 PythonHandler 指令限制为仅暴露必要的模块路径，避免使用 PythonPublisher handler。鉴于 mod_python 已停止维护，强烈建议迁移至 mod_wsgi（Apache 官方推荐的 Python WSGI 模块）或使用 mod_proxy 配合独立 WSGI 服务器（如 Gunicorn/uWSGI）运行 Python 应用，从根本上消除该攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000477","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8997.php","http://www.modpython.org/pipermail/mod_python/2002-April/001991.html","http://www.modpython.org/pipermail/mod_python/2002-April/002003.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-070.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4656","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0185.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0185","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0185.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0185.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0185.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0ccbe74701d72e8d7117a09b2db369605fa0bae6/2002/CVE-2002-0185.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0185.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-01xx/CVE-2002-0185.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0185.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0185.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0170.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0170.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0147","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0147.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0157","title":"GNOME Nautilus 符号链接攻击任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Nautilus 1.0.4 及更早版本的文件管理器中，.nautilus-metafile.xml 元数据文件处理存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接，诱使 Nautilus 在处理元数据时覆盖系统任意文件，导致权限提升或敏感数据破坏。攻击条件要求攻击者拥有本地用户权限，无需交互即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0157"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:54Z","remediation":"升级 Nautilus 至 1.0.5 或更高版本。对于现代 GNOME 桌面环境，确保系统已更新至最新版本（GNOME 40+），该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，避免在多用户系统上使用 Nautilus 管理共享目录，并限制本地用户对 .nautilus-metafile.xml 文件的写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/270691/2002-04-29/2002-05-05/0","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8995.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-064.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4373","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e42829e595f1a9b61ce455f2ab870c6325fb1ad/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0157.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0157","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/050a55b80525b99be98f5c84fe46fa8ac25be676/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0157.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0157.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q5x3-947g-ggqv/GHSA-q5x3-947g-ggqv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0157.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0157.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148400_148500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b71dea17-ea31-4e6b-8e6c-5bc46deb8d8a.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--b71dea17-ea31-4e6b-8e6c-5bc46deb8d8a.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0147.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0167","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0167.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0184","title":"Sudo 1.6.x 密码提示堆溢出漏洞","description":"Sudo 1.6.x 版本中的密码提示功能存在堆溢出漏洞，当用户输入超长密码时，程序在内存分配过程中未正确校验缓冲区边界，导致堆内存被越界写入。本地攻击者可通过构造特制的超长密码字符串触发该漏洞，覆盖堆内存中的关键数据结构，进而实现权限提升至 root 级别。该漏洞影响所有 Sudo 1.6.x 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，危害严重。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0184"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-16T00:00:00Z","updated":"2002-05-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Sudo 至 1.6.6 或更高版本，该版本修复了 -p 参数中特殊字符未正确展开导致的堆缓冲区溢出问题。各发行版用户可通过官方渠道安装对应安全更新（如 Debian DSA-128、RedHat RHSA-2002:071）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21420","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0184.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/d08f837f771e6cd83ec9c845b0c4f72f125cbe84/2002/CVE-2002-0184.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0184.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0184.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0184.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0184","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0184.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0184.md","https://github.com/trifectatechfoundation/sudo-rs/blob/e5a01fd7a20a5bfe5da6bc1b5cf7628e721c35c8/docs/sudo-cve.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0184.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0167.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0167.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0167.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0105","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0105.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1592","title":"Apache HTTP Server 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apache 2.0 至 2.035 版本中 ap_log_rerror 函数在处理 CGI 应用错误时，将包含服务器完整路径的错误信息直接发送给客户端，导致敏感信息泄露。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过触发 CGI 错误获取服务器绝对路径，为进一步攻击（如 LFI、目录遍历）提供信息支撑。该漏洞影响范围广，利用条件低，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1592"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-05-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:36Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 2.0.36 或更高版本。具体操作：从 https://httpd.apache.org/download.cgi 下载 Apache 2.0.36 源码包，编译安装替换旧版本；或使用系统包管理器更新（如 yum update httpd / apt upgrade apache2）。如无法立即升级，可在 httpd.conf 中将 ErrorDocument 指令指向通用错误页面，避免 CGI 错误时泄露服务器绝对路径信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.apache.org/dist/httpd/CHANGES_2.0","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9623.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/165803","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5256","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/54a42d4b01968df1117cea77fc53d6beb931c0e05936ad02af93e9ac%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/5df9bfb86a3b054bb985a45ff9250b0332c9ecc181eec232489e7f79%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r0276683d8e1e07153fc8642618830ac0ade85b9ae0dc7b07f63bb8fc%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r2cb985de917e7da0848c440535f65a247754db8b2154a10089e4247b%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5001ecf3d6b2bdd0b732e527654248abb264f08390045d30709a92f6%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r7035b7c9091c4b665a3b7205364775410646f12125d48e74e395f2ce%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r8828e649175df56f1f9e3919938ac7826128525426e2748f0ab62feb%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9e8622254184645bc963a1d47c5d47f6d5a36d6f080d8d2c43b2b142%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f83489