"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0192","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0192.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0153","title":"Apple Mac OS Internet Explorer 本地脚本执行漏洞","description":"Apple Mac OS 上的 Internet Explorer 3/4/5 版本存在本地应用脚本调用漏洞（Local Applescript Invocation）。该漏洞源于 IE 浏览器未对 HTML 中的 file:// 协议 URL 进行充分的安全检查，远程攻击者可构造包含本地文件路径的恶意网页或 HTML 邮件，利用 `<META>` 标签中的 HTTP-EQUIV refresh 机制自动重定向至本地文件系统，从而在用户不知情的情况下执行本地 AppleScript 脚本或系统程序。攻击者需预先知道目标用户的硬盘卷名及文件路径（如 \"Macintosh HD\"），即可通过 file:// URL 调用 Mac OS 8/9 系统中 \"Speakable Items\" 等本地自动化功能，实现任意程序执行。该漏洞影响 Mac OS 8 和 9 系统上的 IE 5.1 及更早版本，Mac OS X 不受影响。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0153"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:54Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 Internet Explorer 5.1 for Macintosh，该产品已被微软永久终止支持，不再提供安全补丁。升级至 macOS 平台并使用 Safari、Firefox 或 Chrome 等现代浏览器替代。若仍在运行 Mac OS 8/9，需在系统偏好设置中禁用\"语音控制\"（Speakable Items）功能，或通过 Sherlock/控制面板卸载该组件，以消除攻击者通过 file:// 协议远程触发 AppleScript 执行的风险。同时在防火墙或网络层阻止包含 file:// URI 的 HTML 邮件和网页内容。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8851.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5356","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/251805","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3935","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-019","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7969","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21238","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0153.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0153","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0153.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0153.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09e0eb937d6858d58d5e2a369c15112b42549508/2002/CVE-2002-0153.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0153.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/57b318ad84d91f19df2f11e62567e45db1dd90ad/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0153.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-01xx/CVE-2002-0153.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0153.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2002-0153.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0192.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0192.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0192.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0191","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0191.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0148","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0/5.1 HTTP 错误页面跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0/5.1 的 HTTP 错误页面存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。当 IIS 返回自定义错误页面时，未对用户提供的输入进行充分过滤和转义，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的恶意请求，在错误页面中注入任意 HTML 或 JavaScript 脚本。当其他用户访问该错误页面时，注入的脚本将在其浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或钓鱼攻击。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户访问特制链接即可触发该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0148"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:53Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-018 提供的累积补丁 (Q319733)，该补丁修复了 IIS 4.0/5.0/5.1 中 HTTP 错误页面的跨站脚本漏洞。如无法立即打补丁，可使用 IIS Lockdown Tool 禁用不必要的功能，并部署 URLScan 工具过滤恶意请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-09.html","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/Microsoft-IIS-vulnerabilities-MS02-018.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8803.php","http://www.kb.cert.