balizer 2.01-06 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，可完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0180"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:57Z","remediation":"升级 Webalizer 到 2.01-09 或更高版本，该版本修复了反向 DNS 查询中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可在 Webalizer 配置文件 (webalizer.conf) 中将 DNSCache 设为 \"no\" 或设置 UseDNS 为 \"no\" 以禁用反向 DNS 解析功能，从而消除攻击面。建议同时升级到 2.01-09 后再重新启用 DNS 功能，以获得正确的日志分析结果。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101888467527673&w=2","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/582923","http://www.mrunix.net/webalizer/news.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4504","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/8837","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0180.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0180.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0180","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0180.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0180.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0d17d6f83c6018bb718bcfce6a977efcc0a37796/2002/CVE-2002-0180.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0180.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-01xx/CVE-2002-0180.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0180.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0180.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0164.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0161","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0161.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0177","title":"Xiph.Org Icecast 1.x AVLLib缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Icecast 1.x 流媒体服务器中的 AVLLib 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的超长 HTTP GET 请求（来自 MP3 客户端）触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Icecast 1.3.11 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，完全控制受影响服务器。目前官方已发布修复版本，建议用户升级至 Icecast 1.3.12 或更高版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0177"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:56Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Icecast 2.x 系列最新版本（当前为 2.5.0），Icecast 1.x 全系列（≤1.3.11）已停止维护且存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可在源码 `src/client.c` 的 `client_login()` 函数入口处添加长度检查：`if(strlen(expr) > 8000) return;` 后重新编译部署，或在网络边界限制对 Icecast 服务端口（默认 8000/8001）的访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101780890326179&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101786838300906&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101793704306035&w=2","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/596387","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4415","http://www.xiph.org/archives/icecast/2616.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21363","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0177.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0177","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0177.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0177.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0177.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c376806cb2dc05fbeb559b5b1364bc1c095ae81e/2002/CVE-2002-0177.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0177.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-01xx/CVE-2002-0177.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0177.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2002-0177.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0161.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0161.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0161.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0159","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0159.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0170","title":"Zope Zope 代理人角色权限绕过漏洞","description":"Zope 2.2.0 至 2.5.1 版本中存在对象访问权限验证缺陷，系统未能正确校验具有代理角色的用户对受保护对象的访问权限，导致低权限用户可越权访问本应受限的文档内容。攻击者无需复杂条件即可利用该漏洞获取未授权访问，造成信息泄露或权限提升。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0170"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:55Z","remediation":"立即升级 Zope 至 2.5.1 以上版本，并安装 Zope 官方提供的代理角色权限修复补丁（hotfix）。使用 Red Hat 系列发行版的用户应安装 RHSA-2002:060 提供的更新包。如无法立即升级，可在 Zope 管理界面中审查并移除不必要的代理角色分配，限制非管理员用户的代理角色使用权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101503023511996&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8334.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5350","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-060.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4229","http://www.zope.org/Products/Zope/hotfixes/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0170.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b048